module BUG_NESTED_BINDER_COLLISION.

> Regression fixture for nested binders whose source names overlap a rule.
> Pantagruel variables and rules now occupy disjoint SMT namespaces, so the
> inner [x] binder cannot shadow the nullary [x] rule and no solver-level
> alpha-renaming is needed. The companion test checks that native quantifier
> emission uses the variable namespace and remains structurally valid.

D.
x => D.
p a: D => Bool.

---

all x_q: D | p x_q and (all x: D | p x).
